# Runtime data and cache directories.
# .DB_data is no longer bind-mounted; PostgreSQL data lives in the named Docker
# volume "postgres-data". .gems-cache is likewise superseded by the named volume
# "rvm-gems". Both are kept ignored so stale local copies do not enter git.
.DB_data/
.gems-cache/

# These three ARE bind-mounted by .devcontainer/devcontainer.json, so their
# directories must exist in a fresh clone. Ignore the contents, keep the .gitkeep.
.DB_backups/*
!.DB_backups/.gitkeep
.DB_logs/*
!.DB_logs/.gitkeep
.playwright-cache/*
!.playwright-cache/.gitkeep


